    √(priceC hqKappa 13091 (hqLocation c) hqEpsilon (hqExp c) hqEnergy (hqDisplacement c)
      (hqEnergyMoment 8) (hqLocationMoment c 8) (hqEnergyMoment 12) (hqLocationMoment c 12) / 4 +
      3 / 4 * cubP 13091 hqEpsilon (85 / 100) (64 / 100) hqEnergy (hqDisplacement c)
        (hqEnergyMoment 12) (hqLocationMoment c 12)) +
      √(Dpap 13091 (splitRemovedBudget c) hqCentreCap (locationVarianceBudget c)
